policy.description:
I used to hold USDC and just watch it sit there because spending it in Nigeria felt like too much stress.

@SurfCashNG changed that. You convert your USDC or USDT and pay directly through every bank and fintech already running in Nigeria. GTB, Opay, Palmpay all of it. The merchant just receives naira like any other payment.

Watch me pay for my birthday hair and Bolt ride entirely with crypto. 🎂🇳🇬
 @SuperteamNG @SurfCashX

